UID:file-2026-return@simple-money-sheets
DTSTAMP:20261109T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270415
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270416
SUMMARY:File your 2026 tax return (or request an extension)
DESCRIPTION:Your 2026 federal income tax return is due today. If you need m
 ore time to file\, request an extension with Form 4868 by today. An extens
 ion gives more time to file\, not to pay: estimate what you owe and pay it
  today to limit interest and penalties.\n\nIf you're self-employed\, the 1
 st estimated tax payment for 2027 is due today too.\n\nPay online at no co
 st: https://www.irs.gov/payments/direct-pay\n\nWork out your 2027 estimate
 d payments: https://jesse-py.github.io/simple-money-sheets/quarterly-estim
 ated-tax-calculator/?utm_source=calendar&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=file-
 2026
URL:https://jesse-py.github.io/simple-money-sheets/quarterly-estimated-tax-
 calculator/?utm_source=calendar&utm_medium=ics&utm_campaign=file-2026
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:File your 2026 tax return (or request an extension)
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:File your 2026 tax return (or request an extension)
TRIGGER:-PT15H
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
